# Course-only reference pages: excluded from the scaffold copy.
# The QUICKSTART copy recipe uses `git archive`, which honors export-ignore,
# so team repos never receive these files (and their gates never see them).
# docs/sponsored-projects.md previously broke team CI via a dangling relative
# link (gate G4); docs/repo-readiness.md is the all-teams status page and is
# rewritten by the instructor's daily sweep.
docs/repo-readiness.md export-ignore
docs/sponsored-projects.md export-ignore
docs/sprint-schedule.md export-ignore

# Unity text serialization - keep consistent line endings across platforms
*.cs text eol=lf
*.unity text eol=lf
*.prefab text eol=lf
*.asset text eol=lf
